220 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (FurBot was inspired by a personal journey as a dog owner migrating to Canada, facing challenges in navigating an unfamiliar environment. Without established local connections, finding dog-friendly facilities, reliable grooming services, and essential pet care resources was overwhelming. This experience highlighted a significant gap in accessible, localized, and reliable pet care information, particularly for newcomers and urban pet owners.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
221 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To bridge this gap, FurBot was developed as a web-based chatbot designed to provide pet owners with quick and reliable access to essential services and information. FurBot uses predefined intents and responses alongside natural language processing \(NLP\) to accurately handle user queries. Whether locating nearby veterinary clinics, grooming salons, or dog parks, FurBot streamlines the search process, offering real-time recommendations tailored to users' locations.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
222 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Beyond information retrieval, FurBot now includes Pet Profile Management and Automated Reminders, allowing users to:)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
